n Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Tafsiri ya Sura Nooh — Maana ya Qur&#x27;ani kwa maneno ya Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> › Sura Nooh</nav><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Nooh — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</h1><section><p>Aya za sura hii zenye maelezo:</p><div class=\"vl\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/71-10.html\">10</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/71-15.html\">15</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/71-16.html\">16</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/71-17.html\">17</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/71-23.html\">23</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/71-28.html\">28</a></div></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s71a1\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}